<p></p>
<h1 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"CommunicationServicesInitiative-Produ=
ctVision">Product Vision</h1>
<p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"><span class=3D"TextRun SCXP219903=
88 BCX8" style=3D"color:#000000;"><span class=3D"NormalTextRun SCXP21990388=
 BCX8" style=3D"text-decoration: none;">Communication services initiative v=
ision is to enable effective &amp; consistent communication between NBIN &a=
mp; Client firms/Compass Users through development of common services that =
facilitate <span style=3D"color:#333333;">Transactional, Operational, Regul=
atory &amp; Marketing types of communication. Email is currently the&nbsp;p=
rimary channel for&nbsp;NBIN client communication and it is complex, labor-=
intensive and limited in terms of capabilities with several services reachi=
ng end of life. This makes the communication ineffective at times &amp; res=
ults in email overload, poor user experience &amp; poor awareness for our c=
lients. Our vision is to streamline client communication and make it more e=
ffective by supporting multi-channel communications, personalization based =
on user needs &amp; preferences,&nbsp; decommission legacy tools to address=
 security vulnerabilities and self-serve capabilities which reduce manual e=
ffort.</span></span></span></span></p>
<p style=3D"text-align: left;"><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrap=
per confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-imag=
e" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"237" src=3D"c34edc3295358af3bb3afe43c747fa=
815571b632e3b34e662217c39db2577eea" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments=
/2221533204/image-2026-6-11_13-38-53.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=
=3D1781199533730&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-lin=
ked-resource-id=3D"2755880043" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-link=
ed-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image=
-2026-6-11_13-38-53.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-=
resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"22=
21533204" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"24" tabindex=3D"0" alt=
=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></p>
<h1 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"CommunicationServicesInitiative-Initi=
ativeGoals">Initiative Goals</h1>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"0ab010c7-f247-4a80-a95e-154b67b2330a"><span>Enable common=
 platform services that support omnichannel communication strategy through =
the following channels:&nbsp; Email, SMS, In-App</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e3fc4901-a1f4-42d1-b3d2-d0ee00f09bda"><span>Enable both U=
ser Notifications &amp; Support type services to support following communic=
ation between NBIN and Clients/Compass Users- Transactional, Marketing, Ope=
rational and Regulatory</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"cb47f5d6-ccff-4b2e-b3cb-f64414afb865"><span>Migration of =
existing user cases to new Compass and operationalization to support new us=
e cases. Address security vulnerabilities by decommissioning legacy tools a=
nd services. (R2 notification services, NPAT, client bulletins &amp; secure=
d inbox.)</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b6d6fd16-a0e2-47ab-9c5c-813574e4ebcc"><span>Automation of=
 communication tasks and reduction in manual effort with introduction of se=
lf-serve capabilities across the user journey.</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"dffc29cf-9337-484a-a056-18d7b27de0f3">Increase communicat=
ion effectiveness by introducing targeting, personalization, scheduling, ag=
gregation &amp; classification capabilities.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"5d371590-4fae-4148-9e50-37abb6a66a3e">Make communication =
more digestible, manageable by enabling users to define their preference an=
d self-serve capabilities for firms.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"0f7bc10f-a39a-4e43-829c-7d8bd6ab8e2b"><span>Support the N=
BIN communication strategy for notification &amp; support communication.</s=
pan></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"1333ed42-3e33-448d-ab82-fac3be9217e9"><span>Support the N=
BIN goal of converging into a single platform navigation</span></li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p><strong><span>Benefits for NBIN:</span></strong></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"5f442cb0-f89d-4766-a639-32d0f3b7183f"><span>User Engageme=
nt: Enables us to increase user engagement thereby increasing CX adoption.<=
/span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"fb5756da-dfd8-4021-b544-34e15f154b24"><span>CSAT: This fe=
ature would result in increased customer satisfaction and communication has=
 been a pain point for our clients for long.</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"bb47524b-e6b4-4913-84e8-336147330b15"><span>Enhanced capa=
bilities: Ability to support new use cases which are current capabilities d=
on't support (in-app communication, targeted, personalized communication)</=
span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b1a775ce-be89-419f-ae81-66d97bcad6d6"><span>Cost Savings:=
 Decom legacy tools and bring consistency across all NBIN communications</s=
pan></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"780ff370-3da0-4457-ad7a-fe55d691d22f"><span>Automation - =
Reduce manual efforts across NBIN teams</span></li>
</ul>
<p><strong><span>Benefits for Users</span></strong></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"034eed3c-499c-4ff1-acaf-82ff6bb5fab1"><span>Reduce Email =
Overload - In-app communication capabilities open up a new channel for comm=
unication and allows users to access all communication within a centralized=
 location in CX</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"bd81a587-6a07-4f25-bd92-8f27bb922379"><span>User Efficien=
cy: personalized communication and classification of communication allows u=
ser to easily locate details without missing any critical communication the=
reby increasing user efficiency.</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"48b318aa-5539-43a4-b7f8-e1d7cac4bb2c"><span>Task prioriti=
zation - Allows users to easily prioritize tasks due to the ability to diff=
erentiate and identify time sensitive tasks</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"6032359e-a7f5-4a13-8c65-ab0c78379157"><span>Awareness - A=
llows users to be aware of all latest information and updates due to consis=
tency and improvements in communications from NBIN</span></li>
</ul>
<h1 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"CommunicationServicesInitiative-Initi=
ativeScope">Initiative Scope&nbsp;</h1>
<p style=3D"text-align: left;">Key reasons for working on this now (2026):<=
/p>
<ol style=3D"text-align: left;">
 <li data-uuid=3D"87d33289-13ee-4109-ac2f-aba7f9736ba5">Support the organiz=
ational goal of converging into a single platform navigation by end of 2026=
:=20
  <ol>
   <li>Requires critical legacy platform functions to be migrated, includin=
g the replacement of email notifications utility for users and existing in-=
app channels</li>
   <li>Requires specifically the system health status + related notificatio=
ns to be fully supported by end of Q2, when most Tools &amp; Apps will be m=
igrated to new Compass</li>
  </ol></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"1f28bfc7-4777-4db8-8bcd-640e3feec7c9">Two platform naviga=
tion leading to user overload and impacting client satisfaction and user ex=
perience<br>
  <ol>
   <li>Multiple clicks required for the user to subscribe/unsubscribe to em=
ail notifications and access announcements through bulletins.</li>
   <li>Inconsistent user experience between CX and R2 with regards to syste=
m health communication within the application</li>
  </ol></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"ee4179cd-cf14-44bc-9c1a-4940d348bef2">Growing inefficienc=
ies for NBIN teams specifically around product-related release / outage com=
munications across two platforms, which is unsustainable</li>
</ol>
<p><br></p>
<p>Our focus for 2026 is to decommission legacy services and introduce enha=
ncements based on user feedback and pain points identified across the user =
journey.&nbsp;Introduction net new features will be taken up in phase 2.</p=
>
