<h1 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"CommunicationServicesInitiative-Curre=
ntStateAssessment">Current State Assessment</h1>
<p>Refer below links for further details.</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d82c131b-02e7-4f27-8755-da7f64924206"><a href=3D"https://=
wiki.bnc.ca/spaces/COMPASS/pages/2230202561/1.+Communication+Touchpoints" r=
