</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"1f7cfd22-e577-495b-a36d-a06b5b1ed54c"><a href=3D"https://=
wiki.bnc.ca/spaces/COMPASS/pages/2285907911/5.+Use+Cases+-+Notifications" r=
el=3D"nofollow">5. Use Cases - Notifications - NBIN Product Team - Confluen=
